# Lua + JSON join scripts, served to game servers at boot.
# Gitignored (the signed wrapper is generated at delivery time).
#
# - gameserver.lua     signed with V2, served at /Game/Gameserver.lua
#                       (2012-2016 era Lua join script format)
# - gameserver.json    served at /Game/Gameserver.json
#                       (2016+ JSON join script format, 2018M uses this)
# - studio.lua         signed with V2, served at /Game/Studio.ashx
#                       (Studio Test mode, similar shape to gameserver.lua)
#
# The wiki's articles/infrastructure/api/joinscript.md documents the
# 2016+ JSON format; the 2012-2016 Lua format is the body of the
# original Roblox GameServer.ashx.
